<!--Header Study-->
<div class="rug-wrapper rug-wrapper--fullwidth rug-wrapper--flush rug-mt-m">
<div class="rug-header-fullwidth">
<img class="rug-header-fullwidth-img" src="/education/studyprogram-images/ba-informatiekunde.jpg" alt="Header image Information Science"></div>
<div class="rug-wrapper rug-relative">
<div class="rug-absolute--bottom-m">
<div class="rug-panel--content">
<span class="rug-panel--content__meta"><strong>Bachelor</strong> - full-time</span>
<h1 class="rug-h2">Information Science</h1>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Content -->
<div class="rug-background-white rug-pt">
<div class="rug-wrapper">
<div class="rug-layout rug-layout--l">
<div class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-13-24">
<div class="rug-theme--content">
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<p class="rug-lead">How can we automatically analyze and understand large amounts of
data? How can we develop new information technology in such a way
that human needs are central? Are AI models like ChatGPT really as
smart as they appear to be, and how can we improve them?</p>
<div>The availability of digital data and the rise of AI have
drastically changed the world. In the BSc Information Science
program, you'll learn practical skills to use data and AI
applications effectively and responsibly, so you can stay ahead in
the digital society of the future.<br>
                  
<br>
                  
<h4>
                     
<strong>Information Science at the University of Groningen:
<span>Applied AI, Data Science &amp; Language
Technology</span>
                     </strong>
                  
</h4>
                  
<br>
These days, everything revolves around data, or
<em>information</em>. The Information Science program, which is
situated at the intersection of computer science, artificial
intelligence, data science, and language technology, trains you to
automatically process, edit, and analyze these enormous amounts of
data in a systematic and responsible way. You will learn to develop
and evaluate software. You will consider the needs of people and
society. You will become an indispensable data specialist for the
future, with both practical and theoretical expertise. You will be
trained by an enthusiastic group of international researchers: the
language of instruction is ​English. <br>
                  
<br>
                  
<br>
               
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-11-24">
<div class="rug-panel rug-panel--callout">
<div data-variants="rug-panel--callout__heading--primary rug-panel--callout__heading--secondary rug-panel--callout__heading--neutral" class="rug-panel--callout__heading rug-panel--callout__heading--secondary">
