</div>
</div>
</div>
<div data-toggle-id="year-2" data-toggle-group="course-years" data-toggle-class="js-togglable-content--active" class="js-togglable-content">
<div>
<div>
                                 
<p>In the second year of your studies, you will broaden your
theoretical knowledge of data science and get the opportunity to
apply your programming skills to AI applications such as language
technology, intelligent software, and human-centric
technologies.</p>
                              
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-table-wrapper">
<div class="rug-table-holder">
<table class="rug-table--default">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class="rug-table--default__emptycell"></th><th colspan="4">Semesters</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th width="80%">Courses<span class="rug-right rug-font-italic rug-font-s"><a href="https://ocasys.rug.nl/2025-2026/catalog/programme/PROG-11">Course Catalog &gt;</a></span></th><th>1a</th><th>1b</th><th>2a</th><th>2b</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Search Engines (5&nbsp;EC)</td><td><span class="active"></span></td><td></td><td></td><td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
