</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div data-toggle-id="year-3" data-toggle-group="course-years" data-toggle-class="js-togglable-content--active" class="js-togglable-content">
<div>
<div>
                                 
<p>In the third year, you will take courses that explore current
data science topics. You will learn how people and AI can
collaborate creatively and analyze the impact of new technologies
on society. You will conclude your studies with a research project
in which you develop and critically evaluate a technological
application.</p>
                              
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-table-wrapper">
<div class="rug-table-holder">
<table class="rug-table--default">
<tbody>
