<h2>Contact</h2>
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
<a href="/let/studeren-bij-ons/bachelor/prospective-ba-form">Ask Your Question Here </a> (please fill in this contact form, we will answer you as soon as possible.)</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Albert Everaarts (Studieadviseur)<br>Email: <span class="js--decode" data-encoded="PGEgaHJlZj0ibWFpbHRvOnN0dWRpZWFkdmlzZXVyaWtAcnVnLm5sIj5zdHVkaWVhZHZpc2V1cmlrQHJ1Zy5ubDwvYT4=">studieadviseurik rug.nl</span>
</li>
